OL,3,GNEWSANew council faces #43m budget gap,
OL,4,Aleader warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new East Lancashire council could be
OL,7,Fforced to find #43m in savings before
OL,8,Fit delivers a single service, according
OL,9,Fto local authority leaders.
OL,11,FThe proposed Pennine Lancashire unitary
OL,12,Fauthority is due to replace Blackburn
OL,13,Fwith Darwen, Burnley, Hyndburn, Pendle
OL,14,Fand Rossendale councils in April 2028.
OL,16,FBut when the decision was handed down
OL,17,Ffrom central government in July, local
OL,18,FMPs said it could end up being "one of
OL,19,Fthe most deprived unitary authorities
OL,20,Fin the country".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
