OL,3,GNEWSANew council faces #43m budget gap,
OL,4,Aleader warns
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a Blackburn with Darwen Council
OL,7,Fmeeting, leader Phil Riley said the
OL,8,Fproposed Pennine Lancashire authority
OL,9,Ffaced the "significant challenge" of
OL,10,Ffinding #43m in savings in order to
OL,11,Fbalance its budget.
